    "authoring": {
      "intent": "in a transaction without a reservoir, P's slot 0, whose original is 7, is written to 8, its record's 3,520 of history paid from P's regular gas; C, run by P's DELEGATECALL on P's storage with no reservoir, emits an empty LOG0, 2,816 of history from its regular gas, and writes the slot back to 7, giving the 3,520 into its own reservoir; C's next GAS, returned as the transaction's output, reads its regular gas, which the give-back did not raise; C and P succeed, so the 3,520 join P's reservoir and the first frame's, and return to the sender"
    },
